<title>AUSTRALIA: Top 20 Australian Dividend Yields - August 6.</title>
<headline>Top 20 Australian Dividend Yields - August 6.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-08-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Twenty highest dividend yields for Australian companies included in the 320-share All Ordinaries Index based on closing prices on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Dividends based on rolling 12 months.</p>
<p>Yields are not grossed up for franking credits.</p>
<p>				  Dividend</p>
<p>Rank Name		     Yield    Close</p>
<p> 1   Mt Leyshon Gold	16.03     1.56</p>
<p> 2   Davids Limited	 11.90     0.84</p>
<p> 3   Cudgen R.Z.	    10.42     2.40</p>
<p> 4   Natl Consol	     9.68     0.93</p>
<p> 5   Aust Tour		 9.49     0.79</p>
<p> 6   Prime Credit Tr	 8.74     1.11</p>
